        "# LBYL\n",
        "\n",
        "“Look before you leap” is a style that checks preconditions before attempting an operation. In concurrent code, a condition can change between the check and the operation.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-LBYL)"
      ]
    }
